.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-STATUS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-status , rgostatus
.Nd show Reticulum interface and transport status
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm status
.Op Fl config Ar path
.Op Fl json
.Op Fl a
.Op Fl n Ar filter
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl s Ar key
.Op Fl r
.Op Fl timeout Ar duration
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Queries a running shared instance over msgpack RPC and prints interface
statistics (and optionally link count).
Against a Go daemon, output may include local mesh health counters such as
IFAC and HMAC failures, announce signature rejects, unpack failures,
integrity fail rate, and stale link closes. Python
.Nm rnsd
does not populate those fields.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-timeout duration"
.It Fl config Ar path
Config file or directory (default
.Pa ~/.reticulum-go ) .
.It Fl json
Emit JSON.
.It Fl a
Include all interfaces.
.It Fl n Ar filter
Filter interfaces by name substring.
.It Fl l
Include link count.
.It Fl F
Show filtered traffic stats per interface and in totals.
.It Fl L
Show transport link traffic share in totals.
.It Fl u
Show tunnel ID and remote transport implementation per interface.
.It Fl s Ar key
Sort by rate, rx, tx, rxs, txs, traffic, announce, arx, atx, prx, ptx, or held.
.It Fl r
Sort ascending (default descending).
.It Fl timeout Ar duration
RPC timeout (default 10s).
.El
.Sh FLAG PARSING
Flags may appear before, between, or after positional arguments. A literal
.Cm --
ends flag parsing. The
.Fl config
option accepts a config file or a directory. A directory uses the file named
config inside it.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
